 "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_1426662262769612_6311685057863124741_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jTav5e9BqS0Q7kNvwHch5aC&_nc_oc=Adqyk1gG-AUESCh0VOqkNQozDIe74N1T9uikHm-Jq25ojGTJ3sineU0IgCKMwXIUusA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR7vLqnKelhqmf_aWT5fZx2aqsLww1djtKYK_DritWVUQ&oe=6AEDDC5E"}, {"file_name": "logo-transparent.png", "id": "1161989966167586", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_1161989969500919_329693315265702608_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qF2-ofLrAeAQ7kNvwHMb6-q&_nc_oc=Adqkana6REQMnzgCKa9y-xJY3KHVtmJx1HBnMa9Fl066l60DqwwWeF_JaLhZrhTR6_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmwrapHEIVSzpbzSLh31gNhcN94XEI_EuGp2K7K2kXnQ&oe=6AEDF2EF"}]}, "id": "1437199887803330", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01.png", "id": "2907512559608947", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312231_2907512562942280_4790508338452449229_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_MYv62L0_3QQ7kNvwHQrmZN&_nc_oc=Adpej6cXCZ7jJ9yvUNCDuAq-Qho88laNxIHSLH2o4YasLeGnb5BXH-j5Gv2CXIbOAhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTiF-lbM4QH_j3smBEsZBJ5IhUXSIjstOdluRVUUKwSmQ&oe=6AEDEEBC"}, {"file_name": "02.png", "id": "1114877094450423", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312267_1114877097783756_969857562965461489_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w9b2_l5dvlAQ7kNvwF0-WUI&_nc_oc=AdozSxQLOAIXal5AWW6vBtCj2rsVzvA6CPWFgJL0_bYaaat32GSr22OP9tEYBf1Wv-Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRCywhh5bUXE-ssYnLjTk6EX-mJdBsiCHPtb4cIzgTz8g&oe=6AEDEB75"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "884131511361956", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314659_884131514695289_5808890142641071213_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3PVor0mfyzwQ7kNvwGe5JO6&_nc_oc=AdqGaoUjVb5pFd8a5QUJ_0Ozdbw1XqjV2WbBaWaGnzCFet2QEke36mOnzoMKi2ZcaCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9Z1U7dZJjNyvMSf0DuMdZImfbgqvNz4pBfFxqcITWnA&oe=6AEE0259"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "2073705526623799", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313063_2073705529957132_5967704642211820566_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZmuwEp3qL-sQ7kNvwG8GBFf&_nc_oc=Adq1dqYqp9r6hc6vmzLEfVF-R-mec5VOSDYq-vEqsULNXbhZJlA_VaIWnIoFIUlSW08&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRYN7Ly3OlaUY_Nt-0melDZzeFuBYYt1Dmsn0xHT2Axtw&oe=6AEDE6E5"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "1110048894841244", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1110048898174577_7636723964820635014_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nwvyDVZIjQ4Q7kNvwGF7lpF&_nc_oc=Ado3cijBrpZA2iHAEgHFf3lZRPzvRzTMHta48tSl4SMw182uzcnzKGCSt2yvmibYGYY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSx8FwP15lv2LDtTSUe_0sM2w49B7zWOvHwkC8CbGcGtw&oe=6AEDE50E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Immuch360", "keywords": ["360", "VR180", "3D", "video", "photo"], "long_description": "Your media. Any screen. Every perspective.\n\nPress 360\u00b0 and a 360\u00b0 photo or video surrounds you. 3D files are in true 3D, VR180 fills a half sphere, an Apple spatial photo floats in front of you, and flat photos and videos play in the window.\n\nNew and experimental, AI relief: on a Quest 3 or 3S, the headset estimates the depth of a flat photo and shows it in 3D; what the photo hides is filled in, not real. The model (99.5 MB) downloads only when you ask, and no photo leaves the headset. 3D photos, 3D scenes and 360\u00b0 panoramas made by Immuch360 on a computer open here: a scene is explored within limits, a panorama's surroundings are generated by AI, and each view says so.\n\nSign in with your phone: enter the code the headset shows in Immuch360 on your phone.\n\nWatch your drone: an Android phone with Immuch360 on a DJI RC-N3 remote sends its live video to the headset on your Wi-Fi, to watch only (experimental).\n\nControls: thumbsticks turn the view and change media, the trigger plays, A or X shows the panel, B or Y goes back. Hands work too.\n\nYour files where they are: the headset, SMB, WebDAV and DLNA shares, a phone or computer on the Wi-Fi, Plex, or your Immich server. Raw Insta360, GoPro MAX and DJI Osmo 360 files are stitched in the headset.\n\nTested on a Quest 3. Free and open source (GNU AGPL v3), no ads, no analytics.\n\nImmuch360 is an unofficial fork of the Immich mobile app, not affiliated with nor endorsed by Immich, FUTO, Plex, Meta, Apple, Insta360, GoPro or DJI.", "short_description": "Your photos and videos all around you: 360\u00b0, VR180 and true 3D, panoramas, and flat ones too, played in place from the headset, a NAS, Plex, a phone or a computer at home, or your Immich server. New and experimental: AI relief shows a flat photo in 3D, its depth estimated in the headset, and the 3D scenes and 360\u00b0 panoramas Immuch360 makes on a computer open around you. Watch your drone's live video from an Android phone on a DJI RC-N3 remote (experimental). Free and open source, no account."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360/blob/immuch360/PRIVACY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "APROGSYS", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360/issues", "website_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEME